- `emblem.png` — flame-in-medallion mark, square, for favicons / nav / ornament.

**preview/** — Design System tab cards (colors, type, spacing, components, brand). Open `preview/*.html`.

**ui_kits/website/** — marketing-website UI kit: `index.html` (interactive multi-screen prototype: Home · Meniu · Evenimente · Despre) + JSX components. See its own `README.md`.

**fonts/** — drop self-hosted webfonts here if you replace the Google Fonts CDN.

